<title>NORWAY: Oil loadings normal at Statfjord, Gullfaks fields.</title>
<headline>Oil loadings normal at Statfjord, Gullfaks fields.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crude loadings at the North Sea Statfjord and Gullfaks developments were normal on Tuesday and both fields were running at full production, operator Den norske stats oljeselskap AS said.</p>
<p>&quot;There are two tankers loading, the weather is fine and we're at full production,&quot; a Statoil spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Crude loadings at offshore buoys are often disrupted during the winter months by high winds and swell.</p>
<p>The spokeswoman said the weather forecast for the next few days was good.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
